        "actual_behavior": "argmin_cost reads temp_costs_inc, which holds costs from step 254 (zero-based), while temp_costs holds step 255. If their minimizing overlaps differ, backtracking starts from the wrong first-pass endpoint; the metric hunk does not change that selection.",
